>Rescue message quick card
Send location and format, incident, number of people, dangers and needed help.
Add a landmark, how certain you are, a callback number and whether you will stay. Ask for a readback. In the UK hills call 999 or 112, ask for Police then Mountain Rescue. If you have to move, communicate the new position.

